     :data:`TITLE_ONLY_LOCAL_MARKERS`) scan the title only, unless the caller replaced the list."""
diff --git a/tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_placeholder_sessions.py b/tests/hermes_cli/test_kanban_placeholder_sessions.py
